      "content": "the compliance team won't budge on the full wipe, we have to do it or we lose our certification. i can't toggle a \"run-in\" mode, it's all or nothing on the reset. besides, losing some efficiency for a week isn't a safety issue, it's just an energy cost. why is this such a big deal? unless there's something else i'm missing about those parameters.",
